-02-11T10:33:45Z","body":"Retested it again with both X11 and Wayland:\r\n- `is_sym_numpad` → `& Key::SPECIAL` works fine on X11.\r\n- I was able to get only aforementioned numpad scenario to get stuck (on both Wayland and X11), so moving it to input is probably a better way to do it, since it's not fixing anything else.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650403743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2650468623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102641#issuecomment-2650468623","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102641","id":2650468623,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d-vEP","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-11T11:01:44Z","updated_at":"2025-02-11T11:01:44Z","body":"> Also, can something else except the same numpad scenario still get stuck on Wayla